637/uploads/origins/d90f77b4-7ee5-4942-b44d-58b3d43ae2dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2c96b9980bae9e7762fbe49bab7a856, https://si.imgix.net/b5b2d637/uploads/origins/d90f77b4-7ee5-4942-b44d-58b3d43ae2dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24bc3c8777a4540665614eefb5cab7c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5b2d637/uploads/origins/d90f77b4-7ee5-4942-b44d-58b3d43ae2dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1539eefd0c4641be489ce5c3487dbf0f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello sensei, I absolutely love your art style! I have an original character here, and I'd like to commission you for a furry transformation.\n\nI don't have a back reference for her clothing; if needed, you're welcome to design it yourself. You also have full freedom to simplify or remove clothing elements as you see fit.\n\nI'm particularly fond of her round, paw-like hands. If possible, I'd love to see her using these cute hands for a handjob, and her feet for a footjob. (Please be sure to maintain this chibi/stylized proportions in the drawing.)\"\n\n人物参考:https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HMnyIfoHS9xn5N0exfnAmjNSLZhG-bxF\nfurry体型参考:https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Zl_VIM--Lut2GL-hYiPhoL7zE1ie7vH6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@UDMOxsg/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e71eae74/uploads/origins/a6383761-ab6a-450c-9768-e5a587334451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12d510d67d4d71e77237ebf909228892", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e71eae74/uploads/origins/a6383761-ab6a-450c-9768-e5a587334451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12d510d67d4d71e77237ebf909228892, https://si.imgix.net/e71eae74/uploads/origins/a6383761-ab6a-450c-9768-e5a587334451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d3c5342f50605a28640d